# Test Case Rule: RULE 71: When mseccfg.MML = 1 and a PMP entry has L=1, R=1, W=1, X=0, an access in S-mode or U-mode to the region causes an Access Exception.
##### ASSEMBLY #####
li t0, 0x1
csrw mseccfg, t0
li t0, 0x80000000
srli t0, t0, 2
csrw pmpaddr0, t0
li t0, 0xa6
csrw pmpcfg0, t0
call machine_to_supervisor
li t1, 0x80000000
lw t2, 0(t1)
# Result: mcause = 5

# Extension Must Be Active: NONE
# Many important RISC-V extensions are currently active.
# Test Case Name: mseccfg
# Test Case Type: REGISTER
# Test Case Rule: RULE 72: When mseccfg.MML = 1 and a PMP entry has L=1, R=1, W=1, X=1, an access in M-mode to the region is permitted as a locked shared data region that is read-only.
##### ASSEMBLY #####
li t0, 0x1
csrrs x0, mseccfg, t0
li t0, 0x9f
csrw pmpcfg0, t0
li t0, 0xffffffffffffffff
csrw pmpaddr0, t0
auipc t1, 0
sd x0, 0(t1)
# Result: mcause = 7

# Extension Must Be Active: NONE
# Many important RISC-V extensions are currently active.
# Test Case Name: mseccfg
# Test Case Type: REGISTER
# Test Case Rule: RULE 73: When mseccfg.MML = 1 and a PMP entry has L=1, R=1, W=1, X=1, an access in S-mode or U-mode to the region is permitted as a locked shared data region that is read-only.
