# Many important RISC-V extensions are currently active.
# Test Case Name: mstatus
# Test Case Type: REGISTER
# Test Case Rule: RULE 54: In the mstatus register, the encoding of the SXL and UXL fields is identical to the encoding of the MXL field in the misa register.
##### ASSEMBLY #####
csrr t0, misa
srli t2, t0, 62 # t2 = MXL (bits 63..62)
li t3, 0x3
and t2, t2, t3 # keep only 2 bits
slli t4, t2, 34 # SXL field positioned
slli t5, t2, 32 # UXL field positioned
or t6, t4, t5 # combined new SXL|UXL value
csrr t0, mstatus
